==================================================

Reuse the existing Scene selection highlighting path if there is one.

Do not blindly port RIG emissive highlighting if textured/vertex-colour Scene
meshes have special material rules.

The source already contains warnings that overlay/highlight material changes
can interfere with real texture appearance.

If Scene does not currently visually highlight selected meshes safely:

    rely on outliner highlight + gizmo initially.

Do not break texture fidelity just to add emissive.

